CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

The wavetable instruments in this repository are derived from third-party source
wavetables, listed with their collections in provenance.tsv. No authorship is claimed over
the waveforms: those sourced from CC0 collections (WaveEdit Online, Kimura Taro free
wavetables) are public domain, and the rest are reproduced from freely distributed packs and
presets.

The build tooling and the file structure around them are waived to the extent possible under
law. Rights holders can request removal of any collection; it will be removed on request.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The build tools in the companion repository are MIT licensed.
